### E · Do the guards help?

guarded − unguarded GRPO on COMET-22: -0.000 [-0.003, +0.003]. Error rates (%) unguarded → guarded: wrong_language 0.0 → 0.1, number_mismatch 1.1 → 1.0, short 0.3 → 0.2, long 1.6 → 1.1, copy 0.0 → 0.0, repetition 0.0 → 0.0.

### F · Forgetting on untrained directions

RSFT, DPO and GRPO train on English→German only; SFT (v2) also on German→English, so German→English measures forgetting of a trained direction and English→Chinese an untrained one. *Wrong language* = the output is not in the target language; *near copy* = most character 4-grams of the output occur in the source (includes rewrites of the source in its own language); *exact copy* = the output is the source, verbatim.

